  "description": "Reid Ares | Performance Fat Bike\nDesigned for riders who want to take on challenging terrain, the Reid Bikes Ares is a performance fat bike designed to handle everything from deep snow and soft sand to sticky mud and rugged trails. As the mid-tier model in our Fat bike range, it's built to give riders the confidence to explore further.\nThe massive 4.5\" fat bike tyres provide impressive grip and stability across loose and unpredictable surfaces, allowing the Ares to tackle terrain that regular bikes simply can't. Whether you're riding through sand, snow or mud, the wide tyres help keep you moving when the conditions get tough.\nWhether you're discovering new trails, tackling rugged terrain or looking for a riding experience beyond the ordinary, the Reid Bikes Ares is built to take you there. Capable, versatile and ready for adventure, it's a fat bike made for exploring the previously unexplorable.\nWho is the Reid Bikes Ares for?\nThe Reid Ares Fat Bike is ideal for:\n\nRiders who want to explore challenging and varied terrain\nCyclists looking to ride on snow, sand, mud and rugged trails\nRiders who want the extra grip of 4.5\" fat bike tyres\nAdventurers looking to explore trails beyond where regular bikes can go\nRiders who enjoy off-road adventures and rugged terrain\nCyclists looking for a performance-focused fat bike\nRiders who want a bike built for exploring and pushing boundaries",
